iece and premium packaging aesthetics. The composition is built around a vertical oval long-strip seafood label with rounded corners, rose-gold metallic edging, and a background base color that softly gradients from spicy sauce red to seafood silver gray with a delicate warm pearlescent texture. At the top of the card, rose-gold cursive English lettering reads \"SEAFOOD IN SPICY SAUCE\", arranged in a combined layout style. Below it, large black Chinese headline text reads \"捞汁小海鲜\", using thick, rounded strokes with varied thickness; the final stroke of the character \"鲜\" extends into a flowing connected line, and the title sits partly beyond the oval edge with a subtle drop shadow for depth. Beneath the headline are three overlapping signboards in fresh spicy sauce red, seafood silver gray, and garlic gold tones, each with ultra-thin hot-stamped gold borders and small text reading \"鲜活海产\", \"秘制捞汁\", and \"冰镇锁鲜\" respectively, with text colors unified to match each signboard tone. In the center, a large realistic glass bowl is tilted slightly, filled with glossy spicy sauce, whole shrimp, clams, and visible chili oil highlights; the shrimp tails extend outward beyond the oval boundary. Behind the bowl are bright green cilantro leaves with curled edges and transparent sauce droplets dripping from their tips, topped with vivid red sliced chili rings. On the right side, secondary copy reads \"夏季限定 TOP1\", arranged along the outer curve of the seafood and shell contours, flanked by dimensional chili and shell decorations with soft backlighting and sculptural shadows. Soft fill lighting creates refined rim highlights on the food, herbs, glass, and metallic border, emphasizing a transparent, high-end seafood promotion isolated against a transparent alpha channel background. The final output is an RGBA image with no background."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 710, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type